      "name": "rtcGetDeviceLastErrorMessage",
      "category": "rtcore_device",
      "signature": "rtcGetDeviceLastErrorMessage(Device)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Device",
          "type": "RTCDevice"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "char*",
      "docs": "Returns a message corresponding to the last error code (returned by rtcGetDeviceError) which provides details about the error that happened.\nThe same message will be written to console when verbosity is > 0 or when an error callback function is set for the device.\nHowever, when device creation itself fails this is the only way to get additional information about the error."
